# Illusion Spinners: "You may cast this spell as though it had flash if you control a Faerie. Flying. This creature has hexproof as long as it's untapped."
# Bot1 controls a Faerie (Glamer Gifter), so at the end of Bot2's turn 4 it casts the Spinners ({4}{U}: three Moxen and Black Lotus) at instant speed. Untapped it
# is hexproof, so Bot2's Lightning Bolt cannot target it (CR 702.11b); on turn 5 it attacks, tapping (no vigilance), loses hexproof, and the Bolt - the same one,
# refused before - now targets it and kills it (3 damage on 3 toughness).

